# Build context hygiene. Without this the context ships the rendered site and
# Quarto's scratch directories -- ~60MB of it -- and a root-owned
# quarto-session-temp left behind by an interrupted container render makes the
# build fail outright with "permission denied" from the context sender.
.quarto/
docs/
.git/
*_files/
_book/
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
